{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 83, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s) = 2/(s + 1)^3\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > -1\n  one-sided: f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -1/2, 1/2, 3: max relative difference 4.4e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 83, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace", "ucas": "laplace t^2*e^(-t)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace", "region_of_convergence": "Re(s) > -1", "roc": "Re(s) > -1", "one_sided": "f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)", "rules": "e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)", "lhs": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s)", "value": "2/(s + 1)^3", "headline": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s) = 2/(s + 1)^3"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -1/2, 1/2, 3: max relative difference 4.4e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L{t^2*e^(-t)}(s) = 2/(s + 1)^3\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > -1\n  one-sided: f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -1/2, 1/2, 3: max relative difference 4.4e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 84, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 1)}(t) = sin(t)\n  poles: s = +-i\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 1.8e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 84, "ok": true, "cmd": "ilaplace", "ucas": "ilaplace 1/(s^2+1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ilaplace", "poles": "s = +-i", "roc": "Re(s) > 0", "lhs": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 1)}(t)", "value": "sin(t)", "headline": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 1)}(t) = sin(t)", "details": ["for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 1.8e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 1)}(t) = sin(t)\n  poles: s = +-i\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 1.8e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 85, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Z{a^n}(z) = z/(z - a)\n  region of convergence: |z| > abs(a)\n  one-sided: x[n] for n >= 0\n  rules: a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)\n  check: matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (88 terms) at z = 17/10, 17/5, 71/10 with a = 7/10: max relative difference 2e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 85, "ok": true, "cmd": "ztrans", "ucas": "ztrans a^n", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ztrans", "region_of_convergence": "|z| > abs(a)", "roc": "|z| > abs(a)", "one_sided": "x[n] for n >= 0", "rules": "a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)", "lhs": "Z{a^n}(z)", "value": "z/(z - a)", "headline": "Z{a^n}(z) = z/(z - a)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (88 terms) at z = 17/10, 17/5, 71/10 with a = 7/10: max relative difference 2e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "Z{a^n}(z) = z/(z - a)\n  region of convergence: |z| > abs(a)\n  one-sided: x[n] for n >= 0\n  rules: a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)\n  check: matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (88 terms) at z = 17/10, 17/5, 71/10 with a = 7/10: max relative difference 2e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 86, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Z^-1{1/(z - 1)}[n] = 1 - delta[n]    for n >= 0\n  poles: z = 1\n  taken as causal (right-sided): region of convergence |z| > 1\n  long division in z^-1: 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, ...\n  check: the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 86, "ok": true, "cmd": "iztrans", "ucas": "iztrans 1/(z-1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "iztrans", "poles": "z = 1", "taken_as_causal_right_sided": "region of convergence |z| > 1", "roc": "|z| > 1", "long_division_in_z_1": "0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, ...", "lhs": "Z^-1{1/(z - 1)}[n]", "valid_for": "n >= 0", "value": "1 - delta[n]", "headline": "Z^-1{1/(z - 1)}[n] = 1 - delta[n]    for n >= 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)"}], "files": [], "text": "Z^-1{1/(z - 1)}[n] = 1 - delta[n]    for n >= 0\n  poles: z = 1\n  taken as causal (right-sided): region of convergence |z| > 1\n  long division in z^-1: 0, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, ...\n  check: the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 87, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "F{e^(-t^2)}(w) = sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)\n  convention: F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 6.7e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 87, "ok": true, "cmd": "fourier", "ucas": "fourier e^(-t^2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "fourier", "convention": "F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))", "lhs": "F{e^(-t^2)}(w)", "value": "sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)", "headline": "F{e^(-t^2)}(w) = sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 6.7e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "F{e^(-t^2)}(w) = sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)\n  convention: F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 6.7e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
